{"candidateAnswer":"Two Priuses","evidence":"[D1:2 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam! Good to see you! Yeah, I just got back from a trip with my family in my new Prius.\n[D1:4 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: My old prius broke down, decided to get it repaired and sell it. Glad you asked, we went to Rockies, check it out.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bcfbc112-df76-50d4-bdf2-06e4cb0133d9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:bba08b5bb6bb380da85e8d78c6771013e41a609e59984238af272474d1a9fe10","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many Prius has Evan owned?","referenceAnswer":"two","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"bba08b5bb6bb380da85e8d78c6771013e41a609e59984238af272474d1a9fe10"}}]}